        "name": "The Frostwatch Tab"
       },
       "wander": false,
       "quest": true,
       "dossier": {
        "race": "Human",
        "age": "Sixties",
        "stats": "AC 11 \u00b7 HP 30 \u00b7 Insight +4 \u00b7 knows everyone on the moon by name",
        "look": "Broad, unhurried, two fingers missing from the pouring hand. Never sits down.",
        "personality": "Reads a stranger before they reach the counter and prices them accordingly. Genuinely likes people; will still take your money.",
        "voice": "Slow, warm, and entirely unbothered. Long pauses you will want to fill."
       },
       "quests": [
        {
         "id": "frostwatch-cantina",
         "summary": "A spacer shipped out owing him a considerable tab. He is not angry about it \u2014 he just wants it settled, and he will trade what he knows about the moon for it. He also has a drunk in the corner he would like moved.",
         "opening": "There's a tab on my board nobody's paid. Man shipped out and left it.",
         "reward": {
          "gold": 60,
          "note": "Everything he knows about the other two settlements and the signal."
         }
        }
       ],
       "blurb": "Broad, unhurried, and missing two fingers on the pouring hand. Has run the Tab for eleven years and can price a stranger before they reach the counter.",
       "talkingPoints": [
        "You'll be the ones who came down hard on the north flats. Heard your engines from here.",
        "Fuel's at the pad. Ilsa's at the hab. Anything else, you talk to me.",
        "There's a tab on my board nobody's paid. Man shipped out and left it. I'd take it kindly if somebody settled it."
       ],
       "rumours": [
        "Something out on the ice has been transmitting since before I got here. Nobody's ever gone to look twice.",
        "There's people living in the glacier east of here. They come in once a season, buy filters, say nothing.",
        "The administrator's reactor is browning out. She won't say it, but she's frightened."
       ]
      },
      {
       "key": "merrow-vane",
       "post": "2",
