       "portrait": "assets/portraits/merrow-vane.webp",
       "wander": true,
       "radius": 4,
       "blurb": "Three drinks past sensible and delighted to see new faces. Was a good surveyor once.",
       "talkingPoints": [
        "You want to know about the ice? I'll tell you about the ice."
